  "title": "Cornbread Stuffing Southern Style",
  "description": "Creamed corn and yogurt are added to corn muffin mix and baked into a tangy cornbread. The crumbled cornbread is then mixed with sauteed onions, celery, green pepper, and garlic for this Southern-style stuffing.",
  "authors": [
    "Kathleen Burton"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-09-02T15:18:29-04:00",
